@page "/wiki/leader-traits"
@page "/wiki/leader-traits/{Key}"

@*
    What a leader can hold, which is the first page built from a file of the wiki's own.

    Seven hundred and twenty-eight records, and nothing in an empire can hold one - the ruler's
    picker asks for the starting traits and no empire in anybody's files carries a leader's. So they
    are kept out of the data every visitor fetches to draw a designer, and fetched here instead, the
    first time somebody opens this page.

    Two hundred and thirty-four of them have no name in any language the game ships, being the tiers
    a leader earns while a game is running. Those take the name of the trait they replace, with the
    tier said beside it.

    The second address is one entry of the shelf. It shows the same page and picks that one out, so a
    reader who found the thing they came for can send somebody straight to it rather than to a list
    with an instruction to scroll.
*@

<PageTitle>Leader Traits - Stellaris Empire Manager</PageTitle>

<WikiSection Kind="WikiKind.LeaderTraits" Focus="@Key" />

@code {
    /// <summary>The entry the address names, where it named one.</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string? Key { get; set; }
}
